WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:20.128
Tina: I don’t think any of the ants followed us.

2
00:00:20.928 --> 00:00:23.510
Chuck: Okay, how do we all get back to normal?

3
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.392
Bello: We need to find the gun that shrunk us.

4
00:00:26.472 --> 00:00:26.972
Right, Brad?

5
00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:28.353
Brad: Yup.

6
00:00:28.814 --> 00:00:31.896
If I can reverse the polarity, it will make us big again.

7
00:00:33.508 --> 00:00:34.409
Danny: We tried that.

8
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:35.429
It didn’t work.

9
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.611
That’s how we got into this mess.

10
00:00:37.631 --> 00:00:41.273
Brad: Yes, but it did work once in my garage.

11
00:00:41.553 --> 00:00:45.996
Remember? Brad: We shrunk the glass of water, and then made it big again.

12
00:00:46.016 --> 00:00:49.519
Bello: So it might work this time, Danny.

13
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.541
Dave: I believe the funny-looking guy.

14
00:00:53.241 --> 00:00:54.522
We have to try something.

15
00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:55.963
Tina: I agree.

16
00:00:55.983 --> 00:00:58.805
Brad: We’re so tiny.

17
00:00:59.485 --> 00:01:00.746
We haven’t traveled far.

18
00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:03.208
Brad: The shrink-gun must be nearby.

19
00:01:04.384 --> 00:01:07.026
Bello: Okay, let’s split up into groups and search.

20
00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:13.929
Chuck: Do you remember what it looked like?

21
00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:16.891
Dave: It looked like a little toy.

22
00:01:17.431 --> 00:01:18.932
Do you really think it can help us?

23
00:01:18.952 --> 00:01:20.753
Chuck: I don’t know.

24
00:01:20.773 --> 00:01:26.656
Chuck: Bello doesn’t look like a giant, but he sure looks like [n3@he comes from a different world.

25
00:01:26.676 --> 00:01:29.398
Chuck: I think we should believe what they say.

26
00:01:29.418 --> 00:01:33.220
Bello: I’m used to being so much taller.

27
00:01:35.908 --> 00:01:36.408
Tina: Yeah.

28
00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:39.531
You can’t see very far when you’re this close to the ground.

29
00:01:39.551 --> 00:01:41.812
Bello: That gives me an idea.

30
00:01:42.613 --> 00:01:43.754
Let’s climb a flower.

31
00:01:43.774 --> 00:01:47.156
Tina: Good thinking.

32
00:01:47.737 --> 00:01:48.757
How about this one?

33
00:01:58.024 --> 00:01:59.925
Do you think we can trust those bullies?

34
00:01:59.945 --> 00:02:01.546
Brad: We have to.

35
00:02:01.867 --> 00:02:03.288
We all need to work together.

36
00:02:04.736 --> 00:02:07.078
Brad: I just hope they don’t start any more fights.

37
00:02:07.098 --> 00:02:11.863
Danny: Well, I promise that I’m not going to start any more fights.

38
00:02:15.887 --> 00:02:20.552
Danny: Hey, did you see that?

39
00:02:20.572 --> 00:02:22.554
Brad: It looked like a spark.

40
00:02:22.914 --> 00:02:25.877
Danny: There’s only one thing that makes sparks like that.

41
00:02:25.897 --> 00:02:34.664
Brad: It must be the shrink-gun!

42
00:02:34.684 --> 00:02:35.064
Brad: Look.

43
00:02:35.424 --> 00:02:36.765
It’s so huge.

44
00:02:38.445 --> 00:02:41.046
Danny: And there’s a spider on it.

45
00:02:41.066 --> 00:02:43.387
Brad: It’s huge too!

46
00:02:43.547 --> 00:02:48.268
Danny: And it’s coming this way!

47
00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.091
I’ve got a bad feeling about this.

48
00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:02.152
Brad: My hand feels funny.

49
00:03:05.872 --> 00:03:06.612
Danny: I’m stuck.

50
00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:09.314
Brad: We’re really stuck, now.

51
00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:11.715
Danny: Help!

52
00:03:12.076 --> 00:03:15.177
Help! Brad: We’re stuck!

53
00:03:16.378 --> 00:03:20.240
Danny: Hey, the spider stopped.

54
00:03:21.961 --> 00:03:24.683
Brad: It’s trying to grab the nano-putty.

55
00:03:25.864 --> 00:03:29.446
Brad: Stop, stop!

56
00:03:29.586 --> 00:03:31.127
You don’t know what you’re doing.

57
00:03:31.147 --> 00:03:32.908
Danny: Don’t yell at it.

58
00:03:33.924 --> 00:03:35.626
Brad: It’s going to damage the shrink-gun.

59
00:03:35.646 --> 00:03:38.710
Danny: At least it’s not going to damage us!

60
00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.241
Not again!

61
00:03:47.261 --> 00:03:49.023
Brad: Oh no!
